  "description": "Quest Midland offers convenient accommodation situated perfectly between many of Perth’s northeast attractions. Travel up the hill and escape to the Swan Valley to indulge in award-winning wines, chocolate & cheese. Multiple restaurants and cafes are conveniently located on our doorstep. What’s more, Midland is only 15 minutes from Perth Airport and 30 minutes from the CBD. Quest Midland offers a variety of comfortable and modern serviced apartments to make your stay a true ‘home away from home offering full kitchen and laundry facilities, Quest Apartments has something for everyone. Maintain your wellness goals while staying with us by accessing our well-equipped gym, which offers a seamless blend of ease and convenience for your fitness needs. If you need a little guidance from a local, don't hesitate to chat with one of our friendly staff – we’re here to make your stay one to remember! Limited onsite secure car parking * subject to availability * charges apply.",
